{"2330030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Murder of H.", "steam_appid": 2330030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A VR ESCAPE ROOM WHERE EVERYTHING FEELS REAL </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵️‍♂️ Explore an authentic voxel reconstruction of 221B Baker Street as if you were really there. No complicated menus, no artificial interfaces—just you, your intuition, and a fully interactive environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330030/extras/d783c152f752ebfa576ca3cbb700b99e.poster.avif?t=1759326166\" width=760 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330030/extras/d783c152f752ebfa576ca3cbb700b99e.webm?t=1759326166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330030/extras/d783c152f752ebfa576ca3cbb700b99e.mp4?t=1759326166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>🔎 <strong>A Mystery to Uncover</strong> – Sherlock Holmes has disappeared, and the key to the mystery lies hidden in his own room. <strong>Search for clues, experiment, and solve puzzles at your own pace</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥽 <strong>Natural Movement, No Barriers</strong> – Walk freely, crouch to examine details, or reach out to grab objects. No buttons to memorize—<strong>everything feels just like real life</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖐️ <strong>Interact with Everything Around You</strong> – Immerse yourself in a world full of details:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ <strong>Play</strong> Sherlock Holmes’ violin 🎻</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ <strong>Experiment</strong> with chemical mixtures 🧪</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ <strong>Enjoy</strong> the books in his library and uncover hidden secrets 📚</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Puzzles Designed for Exploration and Discovery</strong> – Observe, experiment, and <strong>find the logic behind every puzzle</strong> hidden in the room of the world’s most famous detective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📌 <strong>A Short Yet Immersive Experience</strong> – Designed to be enjoyed in a single session, perfect for those looking for a <strong>VR escape room without long play sessions</strong>.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A VR ESCAPE ROOM WHERE EVERYTHING FEELS REAL </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵️‍♂️ Explore an authentic voxel reconstruction of 221B Baker Street as if you were really there. No complicated menus, no artificial interfaces—just you, your intuition, and a fully interactive environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330030/extras/d783c152f752ebfa576ca3cbb700b99e.poster.avif?t=1759326166\" width=760 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330030/extras/d783c152f752ebfa576ca3cbb700b99e.webm?t=1759326166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330030/extras/d783c152f752ebfa576ca3cbb700b99e.mp4?t=1759326166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>🔎 <strong>A Mystery to Uncover</strong> – Sherlock Holmes has disappeared, and the key to the mystery lies hidden in his own room. <strong>Search for clues, experiment, and solve puzzles at your own pace</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥽 <strong>Natural Movement, No Barriers</strong> – Walk freely, crouch to examine details, or reach out to grab objects. No buttons to memorize—<strong>everything feels just like real life</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖐️ <strong>Interact with Everything Around You</strong> – Immerse yourself in a world full of details:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ <strong>Play</strong> Sherlock Holmes’ violin 🎻</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ <strong>Experiment</strong> with chemical mixtures 🧪</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ <strong>Enjoy</strong> the books in his library and uncover hidden secrets 📚</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Puzzles Designed for Exploration and Discovery</strong> – Observe, experiment, and <strong>find the logic behind every puzzle</strong> hidden in the room of the world’s most famous detective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📌 <strong>A Short Yet Immersive Experience</strong> – Designed to be enjoyed in a single session, perfect for those looking for a <strong>VR escape room without long play sessions</strong>.</p>", "short_description": "Investigate the murder of Sherlock Holmes in an immersive VR adventure. Interact with the world as if it were real, solve clever puzzles, and enjoy a comfortable and accessible experience, perfect for both beginners and seasoned players.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330030/header.jpg?t=1759326166", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330030/327e99a6db35bd38f5a9ebcb14bb5dfcd838a277/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759326166", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330030/327e99a6db35bd38f5a9ebcb14bb5dfcd838a277/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759326166", "website": "https://oniria.world", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</s